{
  "name": "AI Lead Qualifier (BANT + Gemini)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Lead Qualifier\n\n**POST** `/webhook/lead-qualifier`\n\nBody: `name`, `email`, `budget`, `project_description`, `timeline`.\n\nGemini scores the lead with BANT (1–10) and classifies **HOT / WARM / COLD / SPAM**.\n\nFull prompt: `prompts/system_prompt.md`",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "bd77bf63-f467-445a-8ac4-dd5d3876f945",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1808,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Routing\n\nEvery scored lead is written to Airtable on its own branch, so a CRM problem can never block a HOT alert.\n\n- **HOT / WARM** → Telegram + email to sales\n- **COLD / SPAM** → polite rejection to the lead\n- All paths → JSON response to the webhook caller\n\nAirtable needs `AIRTABLE_BASE_ID` and `AIRTABLE_TABLE_NAME` in Settings → Variables.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "49d34652-86a9-4844-86b3-bdf8ad05b563",
      "name": "Note: Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
